s as a goblin and the graphics are somewhat cartoony."},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"14","required_age":"14","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Violência\nAtos criminosos"},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"16","required_age":"16","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt"},"igrs":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"18","required_age":"18","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Simulasi dan\/atau kegiatan judi\nInteraksi Daring\nHoror"}}}}}